     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Personal pronouns in the nominative",
     "texto": [
      "Subject pronouns replace the people or things we're talking about:",
      "**ich** (I) | **du** (you, informal)",
      "**er** (he / masculine nouns: der Bruder → er)",
      "**sie** (she / feminine nouns: die Schwester → sie)",
      "**es** (it / neuter nouns: das Kind → es)",
      "**wir** (we)",
      "**ihr** (you, plural)",
      "**sie** (they, lowercase, with a plural verb: sie wohnen)",
      "**Sie** (formal «you», singular and plural, capitalized, with a plural verb: Sie wohnen)",
      "To tell «she» from «they», look at the verb: **sie wohnt** (she lives, singular with -t) versus **sie wohnen** (they live, plural with -en)."
     ],
